@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

<http://example.org/formats/narrow> rdfs:subClassOf <http://example.org/formats/fasta> .
<http://example.org/formats/fa> owl:equivalentClass <http://example.org/formats/fasta> .
